<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-17685] lfs mirror extend: extend set of mirror lcme flags by LCME_FL_NOCOMPR</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17685</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Command &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;lfs mirror extend -N --flags='nocompr' ...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;results in &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;
lfs mirror extend: unsupported mirror flags: nocompr&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;'nocompr' flag is required for the compress feature and particularly is used by hot-pools when a file is replicated from pool to pool and it is required to keep (no)compression property of the file.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
